I just ftp'd a fresh copy of the source from ftp.uu.net, and I have verified
that the save bug DOES exist.  Maybe it won't dump core on your system, but
it sure does on a UNIX system.

I'm including a patch that fixes some of the bugs that I found below.

By the way, there is an "alt.games.omega" group.

	Kevin W. Thomas

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

The following patch should be applied to the ORIGINAL version of Omega.

This patch fixes the following problems:

o  Armor stats are permanently incorrect when some items are damaged.

o  Save/restore doesn't work.

o  Typing anything other than A-N or ESCAPE in "help" is fatal.

o  Mana could go negative.

o  A monster could talk too much.

